      "role": "user",
      "content": "understood. i'll clear the area. just for my training logs and for my boss, can you explain why these lithium-ion cells act so erratically like this? it feels almost like they have a mind of their own once they start failing. why is the chemical reaction so sudden and difficult to control?",
